      "widgets_values": [
        "A continuous realistic studio shot with exactly two adult women, neutral white background and soft light. Preserve the existing motion, identities, clothing, hands and all other objects. The curly dark-haired woman wears a grey cardigan over a pale pink top and holds her own plain matte BLUE paper cup. Her cup is already blue in the very first frame, stays the same solid blue whenever visible throughout the shot, and is still blue in the final frame. Her cup never returns to brown, beige, grey or purple at the beginning or the end. Only her cup is blue. The blonde woman wears glasses and a white blouse, holding her own unchanged BEIGE paper cup. The blonde crosses the foreground, hiding the dark-haired woman’s cup briefly; the dark-haired woman’s same blue cup reappears afterward. No extra cup, no cup ownership swap, no new person, no sparkles, no cut, no subtitles. Preserve the provided source audio, no added or repeated speech and no music.",
